`w`), their degree boxes (`boxLM`), static `ℓ¹` bounds (`l1LM`) and Kronecker images (`kronLM`);
the family centres `xLM c i` at the parameter `w = c`; the norm bounds `BLM i` of the centres and
the radii `ELM i` of the balls (supplied by the oracle, checked in
